fact WorkItem(id: "WI-104", description: some(value: "Predicate variables (?P) in rule bodies. Extend kernel beyond first-order Horn so a variable can occupy functor position. Required by auto-generated induction principles (proposal 025 §Auto-generated induction rules, lines 145-216). Deliverables: parser accepts ?P(args) in goal position; resolver routes predicate-variable functors through a separate symbol-kind path; pattern-fragment restriction enforced at load (Miller, lines 228-239) — predicate vars only in body position, args must be distinct first-order terms or variables, no nested predicate vars. Acceptance: a hand-written rule using ?P loads without error; pattern-fragment violations produce a clear load error. Prerequisite for WI-106 (kernel principle generation) and WI-101 (induction tactic). See proposal 025 §Auto-generated induction rules."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-029"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-04-27T10:31:05Z"))
